{
  "info": {
    "name": "Walvy — Flow Suscripciones (Cargo Automático)",
    "description": "Colección para probar el flujo completo de Flow Cargo Automático.\n\nVariables de entorno necesarias:\n- FLOW_API_URL     → https://sandbox.flow.cl/api\n- FLOW_API_KEY     → tu API key de sandbox\n- FLOW_SECRET_KEY  → tu secret key de sandbox\n\nFlujo en orden:\n1. Crear Plan\n2. Crear Cliente\n3. Registrar Tarjeta\n4. Verificar Registro de Tarjeta\n5. Crear Suscripción\n6. Cancelar Suscripción (opcional)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "FLOW_API_KEY",
      "value": "",
      "description": "API Key del comercio en Flow"
    },
    {
      "key": "FLOW_SECRET_KEY",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Secret Key del comercio en Flow"
    },
    {
      "key": "planId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "customerId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "registerToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "subscriptionId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Paso 1 — Crear Plan",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Firma HMAC-SHA256 — igual que el FlowService de Walvy",
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r.planId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('planId', r.planId); console.log('planId guardado:', r.planId); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/plans/create",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "plans",
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "planId",
              "value": "walvy-pro-mensual",
              "description": "ID único del plan en Flow (string, sin espacios)"
            },
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Walvy Pro Mensual",
              "description": "Nombre visible del plan"
            },
            {
              "key": "amount",
              "value": "6990",
              "description": "Monto en CLP"
            },
            {
              "key": "currency",
              "value": "CLP"
            },
            {
              "key": "interval",
              "value": "3",
              "description": "3=mensual"
            },
            {
              "key": "trial_period_days",
              "value": "0",
              "description": "Días de prueba (0 = sin trial)"
            },
            {
              "key": "urlCallback",
              "value": "https://api.sonark.tech/subscriptions/webhook",
              "description": "Webhook de renovación"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Paso 1b — Crear Plan Anual",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/plans/create",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "plans",
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "planId",
              "value": "walvy-pro-anual"
            },
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Walvy Pro Anual"
            },
            {
              "key": "amount",
              "value": "59990"
            },
            {
              "key": "currency",
              "value": "CLP"
            },
            {
              "key": "interval",
              "value": "4",
              "description": "4=anual"
            },
            {
              "key": "trial_period_days",
              "value": "0"
            },
            {
              "key": "urlCallback",
              "value": "https://api.sonark.tech/subscriptions/webhook"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Paso 2 — Crear Cliente",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r.customerId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('customerId', r.customerId); console.log('customerId guardado:', r.customerId); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/customer/create",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "customer",
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Miguel Herize",
              "description": "Nombre del cliente"
            },
            {
              "key": "email",
              "value": "miguel.herize@kabeli.cl",
              "description": "Email del cliente"
            },
            {
              "key": "externalId",
              "value": "usr_xxxxxxxx",
              "description": "UUID del usuario en Walvy (app_user.user_id)"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Paso 3 — Registrar Tarjeta",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('registerToken', r.token); console.log('registerToken guardado:', r.token); }",
              "if (r.url)   { console.log('Abrir en browser:', r.url + '?token=' + r.token); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/customer/register",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "customer",
            "register"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "customerId",
              "value": "{{customerId}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Miguel Herize"
            },
            {
              "key": "email",
              "value": "miguel.herize@kabeli.cl"
            },
            {
              "key": "urlReturn",
              "value": "https://api.sonark.tech/subscriptions/card-return",
              "description": "URL donde Flow redirige al usuario tras ingresar tarjeta"
            },
            {
              "key": "urlConfirmation",
              "value": "https://api.sonark.tech/subscriptions/card-confirm",
              "description": "Webhook de confirmación de registro"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Paso 4 — Consultar Estado Registro de Tarjeta",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// El token llega en el urlReturn (query param o body POST del formulario)",
              "// Aquí usamos el registerToken guardado en el Paso 3",
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const token     = pm.collectionVariables.get('registerToken');",
              "",
              "const params = { apiKey, token };",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(params).sort().map(k => k + params[k]).join('');",
              "const sig    = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "",
              "pm.request.url.addQueryParams([",
              "  { key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey },",
              "  { key: 'token',  value: token  },",
              "  { key: 's',      value: sig    }",
              "]);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log('Estado registro:', JSON.stringify(r));",
              "// Guardar customerId si viene en la respuesta",
              "if (r.customerId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('customerId', r.customerId); console.log('customerId confirmado:', r.customerId); }",
              "// status: 1 = tarjeta registrada OK, otros valores = pendiente o error"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/customer/getRegisterStatus",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "customer",
            "getRegisterStatus"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Consultar estado del registro de tarjeta.\n\nEl token viene del urlReturn — el mismo token del Paso 3.\n\nResponse incluye:\n- status: 1 = tarjeta registrada correctamente\n- customerId: ID del cliente (confirma a quién pertenece la tarjeta)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Paso 5 — Crear Suscripción",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "if (r.subscriptionId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('subscriptionId', r.subscriptionId); console.log('subscriptionId guardado:', r.subscriptionId); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/subscription/create",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "subscription",
            "create"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Mínimo requerido: planId + customerId.\nFlow genera los cobros automáticamente a partir de aquí.\nEl response incluye el subscriptionId que hay que guardar para cancelaciones futuras.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "planId",
              "value": "walvy-pro-mensual",
              "description": "ID del plan (Paso 1). Cambiar a walvy-pro-anual para plan anual."
            },
            {
              "key": "customerId",
              "value": "{{customerId}}",
              "description": "ID del cliente (Paso 2 / Paso 4)"
            },
            {
              "key": "couponId",
              "value": "",
              "description": "Opcional — ID de cupón de descuento",
              "disabled": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Extra — Obtener Factura (Invoice)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const invoiceId = pm.variables.get('invoiceId') || '0';",
              "",
              "const params = { apiKey, invoiceId };",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(params).sort().map(k => k + params[k]).join('');",
              "const sig    = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "",
              "pm.request.url.addQueryParams([",
              "  { key: 'apiKey',    value: apiKey    },",
              "  { key: 'invoiceId', value: invoiceId },",
              "  { key: 's',         value: sig       }",
              "]);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/invoice/get",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "invoice",
            "get"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Obtener el detalle de una factura de suscripción.\n\nStatus del invoice:\n  0 = impago\n  1 = pagado\n  2 = anulado\n\nError:\n  0 = sin error\n  1 = falló el cargo (ver errorDescription)\n\nCampos clave para Walvy:\n  - period_start / period_end → actualizar currentPeriodEnd en subscriptions\n  - status = 1 → renovación exitosa\n  - error = 1 → cargo falló, ver next_attemp_date y paymentLink\n  - paymentLink → URL para que el usuario pague manualmente si el cargo automático falló\n  - chargeAttemps → historial de intentos fallidos"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Extra — Cancelar Suscripción",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const secretKey = pm.environment.get('FLOW_SECRET_KEY');",
              "const apiKey    = pm.environment.get('FLOW_API_KEY');",
              "const body = {};",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.each(i => { if (!i.disabled) body[i.key] = i.value; });",
              "body.apiKey = apiKey;",
              "const toSign = Object.keys(body).sort().map(k => k + body[k]).join('');",
              "const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(toSign, secretKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 'apiKey', value: apiKey });",
              "pm.request.body.urlencoded.upsert({ key: 's',      value: sig    });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{FLOW_API_URL}}/subscription/cancel",
          "host": [
            "{{FLOW_API_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "subscription",
            "cancel"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "subscriptionId",
              "value": "{{subscriptionId}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}